{
  "abstract": "This action amends Very High Frequency Omnidirectional Range (VOR) Federal Airways V-161, V-163, and V-568; and establishes United States Area Navigation (RNAV) Route T-545. The FAA is taking this action due to the planned decommissioning of the VOR portion of the Three Rivers, TX (THX), VOR/Tactical Air Navigation (VORTAC) navigational aid (NAVAID). The Three Rivers VOR is being decommissioned in support of the FAA's VOR Minimum Operational Network (MON) program.",
